        "original_id": "eb8039ad-fafc-5a90-abd1-75ce48128755",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. V. Prakash Kumar, Ashrita Shetty, Vetrimaaran, Manimaran, Vinod, Prashant Narayanan\n- Films: Udhayam NH4, Veyyil, Naan Thaan Siva\n- Companies: S Pictures\n- Roles: lead role, antagonist, composer\n\nFacts:\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar's first film was S Pictures' \"Veyyil\" in 2006.\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar became popular in Tamil cinema by the early 2010s.\n- Vetrimaaran and Manimaran approached Ashrita Shetty to play the lead role in \"Udhayam NH4\".\n- G. V. Prakash Kumar composed the soundtrack and background score for \"Udhayam NH4\".\n- \"Naan Thaan Siva\" features newcomer Vinod and Ashrita Shetty in the leading roles.\n- Prashant Narayanan portrays the antagonist in \"Naan Thaan Siva\".",
